This function is already minimal; I only hoisted the bounds value and switched to pointer arithmetic on the components array, letting the compiler avoid recomputing the field base address for the indexed access.

```cpp
const Profile::FIELD_COMPONENT* Field::GetComponent(const FIT_UINT16 component) const
{
    if (component >= GetNumComponents())
        return NULL;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].components + component;
}
```